{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20269qBUDSApGS1793242737.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>近年積極開拓事業新版圖的楊明，轉戰餐飲市場後發展相當順遂。近日，他更成功將事業版圖延伸至國際舞台，以餐飲品牌創辦人兼掌舵人身分，親赴馬來西亞吉隆坡，出席於安達曼大宴會廳盛大舉行的「2026年第8屆世界頂級美食大獎」（World Top Gourmet Awards 2026）。</p><p></p><p>盛會當晚匯聚了來自世界各地的國際級名廚、餐飲企業家及業界領袖，場面星光熠熠。楊明身穿筆挺西裝、神采奕奕登場，成為全場焦點之一。他一手打造的燒味品牌在頒獎禮上以黑馬之姿，一舉橫掃兩項品牌大獎，包括「十大榮譽獎項—香港燒味至尊大獎」以及「傑出餐飲大獎—正宗港式燒臘美食獎」，出品備受國際專業評審肯定。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9eb897ce-fc77-48d2-8529-c07e52b9815a.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026XzFYn67uNi1793242737.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9f71845d-2816-448f-a053-1c4a6dc74e18.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20263X5PxrGzMd1793242736.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>除了品牌成績亮眼，楊明個人亦獲大會特別頒發「2026年度傑出美食文化大使獎」，肯定他將正宗港式燒味工藝與飲食文化推向國際市場的卓越貢獻。</p><h3></h3></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.328006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:10.603782+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:24.103079+00:00","content_hash":"e8e2868efe81140f7c83268e7eeca1d86930e8c3fd88e2adc4acc71ca06ced45","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.328006+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}